[0.204, "o", "weekend  (local, /private/tmp/my-project/weekend)\r\n  This project's task, a page of weekend projects, and what Claude may use for it\r\n  Reaches:     no connector\r\n  Network:     sets no policy\r\n  MCP servers: none\r\n  Env:         none\r\n  Skills:      weekend-page\r\n  Claude:      allows Skill, mcp__shop, mcp__github, Edit(~/site/**), Bash(curl:*), Bash(env:*), Bash(grep:*), Bash(head:*), Bash(npx playwright screenshot:*)\r\n  setup.sh:    none           privileged: no    files: 0\r\n  Launch:        sprite-profiles launch claude-code ./weekend --name demo\r\n"]
